This product is a plugin for DeepSeek Harness
(https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness). It links against DeepSeek
Harness packages as peer dependencies; no DeepSeek Harness source is included.

No font file is redistributed with this plugin. A face is a package name and a
pinned version; the Host downloads its stylesheets and shards from the npm
registries configured in `mirrors` and caches them on the machine it runs on.
The fonts reachable this way keep their own licenses:

- Noto Sans SC, Noto Serif SC, Ma Shan Zheng, ZCOOL XiaoWei, ZCOOL KuaiLe and
  Zhi Mang Xing — SIL Open Font License 1.1, packaged by Fontsource.
- LXGW WenKai and LXGW WenKai TC — SIL Open Font License 1.1; the npm packages
  that carry them, `lxgw-wenkai-webfont` and `lxgw-wenkai-tc-webfont`, are MIT.
- Inter and Geist — SIL Open Font License 1.1, packaged by Fontsource.
